**In `packages/services/service-ai/src/plugin.ts`:**

1. Remove the redundant second `ctx.getService('metadata')` call on line ~312
2. Reuse the already-resolved `metadataService` variable from line ~250 instead
3. Remove the unnecessary try/catch wrapper since we're just checking if the already-obtained variable is defined

Change the agent routes block (around lines 310-320) from:
